nt/windham-county"],["ARC or PLC in Windham County","/arc-plc/vermont/windham-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 that middle ran 51% of normal in July to August and 164% in April to May. Every grid shown had its driest year in 1964, with grid 27231 at 67%.</p>"}
